Subject: mt7915: recover Kite after a proven control timeout

A mailbox timeout must stop ordinary updates, but it must not permanently
strand a live session when a fresh status read still proves ownership.  Drive
the documented PARK/DATA_STOP/UNBIND/DATA_RECOVER sequence, retain quarantine
when the proof is unavailable, and clear the recovery latch only after the
firmware accepts the rearm.

